msgctxt "80"
msgid "Guh... How the hell did you...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Keep your filthy hands off Stardust from now on. Permanently."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Yes... Understood..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "You all right, Kazuki-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Why'd you run off by yourself like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"I couldn't forgive myself for doubting you, so I just snapped and... Well, "
"there you have it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Kazuki-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "I don't know what's wrong with me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"I always lecture the staff like I have all the answers, but where would I "
"be without you guys?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "I know we gotta stick together. And that's why I'm still here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Looks like you were both trying to do what's best for Stardust, each in "
"your own way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "I'm sorry we got you sucked into this thing, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Well, where's a guy supposed to relax in this town if Stardust is gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Haha, well you'll always be welcome."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Oh, and I want you to have this. It's not much, but I hope you'll accept it "
"for all you've done for us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Well, now that that's taken care of, what do you say we head back to the "
"club!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "You got 8,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Kazuki-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Yuya... I'm... sorry I ever doubted you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Don't worry about that, Kazuki-san. I mean, I'm the one who should've had "
"more faith..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"It's a shame Eiji couldn't do his job... But since you were all nice enough "
"to come here to get knocked off, the takeover should still proceed as "
"scheduled."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "So tell me. Would you like your corpses dumped in the sea..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "...Or up in the fuckin' mountains!?"
msgstr ""

